model surf06
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-03-31
  note "SURF-06: a record row with a negative field (LANGUAGE 2.3: a field holds a signed literal; CHANGES.md 2.1-27). The ask reads both fields back as written."

source bank_letter "The bank's letter of 12 February 2026: a correction of the fees (made up)"

unit DUK: currency minor 0.01

input correction: (amount money DUK, months int)

ask q_fields: correction.amount, correction.months

version letter
  cite bank_letter
  governs always
  known 2026-02-12
  correction = (amount: -250.00 DUK, months: 3) "the letter: a correction of -250.00 over 3 months"
